This repository also redistributes third-party skills. Each one keeps its own licence file inside its
folder (skills/<id>/LICENSE or LICENSE.txt), is pinned to the upstream commit recorded in
upstream.lock, and states its modifications in the `metadata.changes` field of its SKILL.md.
Common modification for every copy: the YAML frontmatter was rewritten (license set to an SPDX id;
metadata, stage and topic added) and executable or non-markdown files were left out. Bodies are
verbatim unless the skill is marked `mode: adapt`, in which case the edited lines are described in
`metadata.changes` and in reviews/<id>.md.

